WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.660
Hina!

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:08.660
Yes, Mom?

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:12.120
Wait, you still haven't finished unpacking?

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.700
This little one had an open seam.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.500
I'll finish unpacking when I'm done.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.750
You're in high school now, so you
need to take care of yourself more.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.870
Okay.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.950
You can do this later, but could
you buy some garbage bags?

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.500
Okay.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.700
Hey, is there a craft store here?

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.660
I'm not sure. Why not ask your dad?

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.700
I'm heading out.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.250
This feels so nice!

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.250
"Ashiya Fish Market"

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:04.750
This reminds me of when
Grandpa and I would go on walks.

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:09.000
I was really nervous about
moving to the countryside,

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.450
but it might not be so bad.

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:14.870
I haven't gotten used to
the fishy smell yet, but...

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:18.700
Now to just join the Handicrafts Club
and enjoy my life at school.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:21.500
Yo!

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:32.870
That startled me so much.

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:37.910
The ocean's so pretty, but filled
with so many creepy creatures.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:42.370
I'm not sure if I'm gonna last.

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:56.120
Huh?!

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:04.080
A-Are you all right?!
Should I call an ambulance?!

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:10.540
Ya okay?

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:17.450
I see. So ya thought I'd gotten
heat stroke and ya rushed over?

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:20.160
You were really wobbly, so...

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:23.040
Sorry for confusin' ya.

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:25.120
I was just fishin'.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:28.200
I-I see. Sorry about that.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:33.080
So I was tryin' to untangle this rat's nest.

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:36.040
It's such a dang mess.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.620
Maybe I'll just cut it.

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:45.370
Um... If you don't mind, could you let me try?

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:48.950
Umino?

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:51.910
Oh, what? We go to the same school then.

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:55.290
Yer a new student, eh? What's yer name?

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:58.830
Huh? Oh, it's Hina Tsurugi.

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:01.700
I-It's nice to meet you, Senpai.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.120
The name's Kuroiwa.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.040
It's a pleasure.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:09.160
So ya just moved here, Tsurugi?

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.200
Oh, do ya understand the way we talk?

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:15.950
My dad speaks the dialect here,
so I can sorta understand it.

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:17.200
Here you go.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:18.870
Wow, already?

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:23.700
I love handicrafts.
I'm really good at untangling string.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:28.290
This might not be much of a thanks,

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:29.580
but ya wanna give it a shot?

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:33.830
Huh? But I've never tried fishing before.

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:36.000
Don't you worry your pretty little head.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.540
It's easy, even for beginners.

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:41.200
Wh-What will I be able to catch?

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.950
Ya can find out when ya catch one.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.370
Ya can take it home with ya if ya catch one.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:53.000
Ya take this hook with all the frilly
things on it and just dangle it down.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.540
Simple, right?

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.500
S-Sure...

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:00.540
Keep danglin' it down until it hits the bottom.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.910
The bottom?

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:06.700
You'll feel somethin' once ya
get far enough. You'll know.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.040
Oh, I felt it hit something.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:14.330
There ya go. Now try pullin'
the line up and down.

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:16.200
L-Like this?

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:19.750
Yup. Once ya catch somethin',
it'll get real heavy.

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:21.750
What is "somethin'"?

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.040
I'm scared.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.750
I don't feel anything.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:30.450
Then try steppin' to the side.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:36.000
Still... nothing.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.620
One more step.

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:40.750
Nothing.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.330
Let's try it again.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.660
Nope...

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:47.450
Once more.

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.040
What am I even doing right now?

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:57.450
So, Tsurugi...

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:00.120
Ya like the ocean?

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:04.160
Hm... I do love looking at it.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:09.500
When I'd come visit, I used to
stare at the sun set until it got dark.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.500
Though I can't really swim.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.950
Huh... I see.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.000
H-Huh?

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.160
What's wrong?

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.790
It stopped moving.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:23.200
I wonder if it got stuck on something.

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:28.580
Ya definitely caught something.
Pretty sure it's huge.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:29.700
Huh?!

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:31.790
Give it a big pull.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.080
Yer really strugglin' there.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:38.200
Pull a bit harder.

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:44.120
Ow...

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:45.120
Wait.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:50.080
Hey, good job.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.160
Bet ya thought it was gonna be a fish.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.870
That lure's actually for octopi.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.080
Ya surprised?

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.660
T... T-T-T...

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:01.540
Take it off, please...

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.950
I can't... I can't deal with any creatures...

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:07.120
P-Please get it off me... Please!

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.580
Whoopsie. Sorry 'bout tha--

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.250
I guess I could get that off ya, but...

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:17.200
Say, Tsurugi. Would ya mind joinin' our club?

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:18.290
Huh?!

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:20.620
We don't have enough members.

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:23.040
We're hangin' on by a thread.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:26.330
It'd be convenient if we had a girl
like ya who's good with her hands...

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:29.330
I mean, ya'd be doin' us a great service.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.500
Whatcha think?

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.910
Just so ya know, the octopus
will definitely keep climbing.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:35.200
"Club Application"
