00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:20.700
U-Um, excuse me.

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:23.040
Do you belong to the Breakwater Club?

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:30.450
H-Huh?

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:32.000
Hina!

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.910
It's been so long! How are you?!

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:41.580
I haven't seen you since grade school!

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:43.540
Huh? What?

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:45.540
Wh-Who is she?

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.000
Yo!

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:54.040
G-Get it off me! Please!

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:59.660
Guess you haven't changed at all, Hina.

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.290
Back to the ocean with you!

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:06.160
Guess you still can't handle bugs.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:11.040
You never did try to touch them
when we went to catch cicadas.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.410
Catch cicadas?

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:15.870
Wait. Do you not remember me?

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:19.080
S-Sorry...

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:21.910
It's me, silly! Natsumi Hodaka!

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.540
We used to play together all the time.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.950
Look! My forehead tail! You don't remember it?

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:28.000
Um...

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.660
Oh, Natsumi?!

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:36.700
You finally remember me?

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:40.330
Sorry... I remembered you being much tanner.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.660
I still get super tan during the summer.

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:45.120
How long has it been? Since third grade?

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.410
Yeah, I think that's about right.

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:50.160
Then I can't blame you for not remembering me.

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:53.660
I actually totally forgot about you
until Sis told me about you.

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:55.000
Sis?

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:58.200
I was shocked to hear you joined our club.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.830
You would never come along
when I invited you fishing.

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:02.660
When did you start liking fishing?

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:04.700
No, I--

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:08.910
You're huge!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:12.540
I'm so sorry!

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.620
That's the super big Ohno-<i>senpai</i>.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:18.290
Those are huge, too.

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:23.250
This is the new member
that Sis told us about.

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:25.370
I'm Hina Tsurugi.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:28.000
She seems like a nice person.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:31.290
Man, I didn't catch a thing.

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:32.910
Oh, Sis.

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:39.370
Ya actually came. Good girl.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:42.290
I didn't come here because I wanted to.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:43.910
Wait, are you sisters?

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:46.830
Nah, but we might as well be.

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:48.450
We've gone to the same
schools since grade school.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:51.290
Stop callin' me that at school.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.580
I'm yer <i>senpai</i>, after all.

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:56.330
Now, let's head on in.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:57.910
O-Okay...

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:03.000
I feel so much better.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:06.290
I can't get into it until
I take these suckers off.

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:09.290
That's pretty gross.
Or rather, are you some old guy?

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:12.080
She really is weird...

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:15.830
I need to tell her.

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:16.250
--Um--

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:16.870
--All right. Why don't we introduce ourselves?
--Um--

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:19.580
--All right. Why don't we introduce ourselves?

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:25.450
I'm Yuki Kuroiwa and I'm a third-year.
I'm somewhat the club president.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.660
And the huge one over here is...

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:30.450
I'm Makoto Ohno, and I'm a second-year...

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:32.620
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:35.290
Okay! And I'm Natsumi Hodaka!
I'm 15 and a first-year!

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:37.870
My favorite foods are <i>Napolitan </i>spaghetti
and pork cutlet sandwiches!

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.830
My hobby is to move about!

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:41.700
Thanks for having me!

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:44.040
No one asked for all that.

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:47.540
And this is Hina Tsurugi!
She's also a first-year!

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:48.500
Yes...

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:50.700
You just moved here, right?

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:52.410
Ya gonna speak for her?

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:56.700
But she used to come visit here
all the time in the summer.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:14:00.580
Our houses were real close,
so we ended up playing with each other.

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:03.450
And then, we had our touching reunion!

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:04.540
Right?

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:06.250
Y-Yeah...

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:11.950
Oh, I see. Maybe we played together before, too.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.910
It's so hard to just come out and say it...

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:18.790
But we ended up at the same school
and same club! Isn't that amazing?

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:21.160
It was basically destiny.

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:22.910
Y-You think so?

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:27.370
Man, I'm so relieved ya both joined.

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:31.160
Otherwise, our club might've not survived.

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:33.540
Wait. Are we the only members?

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:37.040
Yup. Let's do our best with the four of us.

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:40.370
P-Please wait a second!

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:43.660
I can't fish...

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:46.750
I just came here to decline today.

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.830
Hina...

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:52.200
I see. Right, then.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.450
Sorry to force ya into joinin'.

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:59.200
But ya know, it might've been
fate that brought us all together.

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:02.540
Why don't ya try fishin' just once before ya go?

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:06.080
It's always good experiencin' new things.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:09.790
--Okay... Just once--

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:10.750
--Right-o. Get ready, gals.
--Okay... Just once--

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:12.200
--Right-o. Get ready, gals.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.290
Yeah!

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:14.250
So fast!

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:18.120
But please no octopi or big fish!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.790
Leave it to me.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:28.330
Don't worry! I'll show you the ropes.

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:29.830
It'll be okay!

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:32.500
The sun's harsh out there.
Make sure ya keep that on.

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:34.870
Right. Let's get goin', gals.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.580
Yeah!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:42.000
Hey, wait... did I say yes too soon?

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:46.120
The weather's great.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:50.080
There's no wind and the water's
calm as usual, so s'all good.

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:53.200
Perfect day for your debut at fishin'.

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:55.830
Well, I did catch an octopus.

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:58.500
I'm basically fearing the worst right now.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:01.040
I'm just going to get this
over with and head home.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.000
What am I fishing for anyway?

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:07.910
No need to hurry.

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:10.250
Everyone's still in their uniforms.

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:12.410
Don't they ever get dirty?

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:15.040
What's that?

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.330
This? It's chum.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:21.790
You take breadcrumbs, krill,
and saltwater and mix it all together.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.160
Here.

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:25.410
It stinks!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.790
How can you even touch that?

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:32.700
What? I mean, you just have to wash
your hands, so it's no big deal.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:38.000
That's the problem with you weak city folk.

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:41.040
This is the problem with you
feral county bumpkins.

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:44.250
So what are we supposed
to catch with that stuff?

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:46.040
Take a look down there.

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:47.330
You'll see it.

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:48.620
Down?

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:52.540
Jellyfish?

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:57.000
Nah. You'll see a school
of tiny ones swimmin' around.

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:59.870
Wow, you're right! There are so many of them!

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:01.250
They're li'l horsies.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.910
Horsies?

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:06.700
Baby horse mackerel.
They're great when you fry 'em up.

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:08.700
W-We're going to eat them?

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:12.540
The Breakwater Club's motto
is ya catch it, ya eat it.

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:15.000
Anyway, just give it a shot.

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:22.620
Th-There're so many hooks! Wh-What should I do?

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:26.700
Calm down. First, put some
chum into that compartment.

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:30.620
It stinks. It's gross.

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.950
You'll survive.

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:35.500
Once you fill it with chum, hold onto the rod,

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:38.450
and wrap the line around your pointer finger.

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:40.000
L-Like this?

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:42.830
And then, move the ring part up.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:44.790
Don't let go of the line yet.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.330
O-Okay...

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:49.410
Okay, let go.

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:55.160
Wow, it's sinking.

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:56.160
It stopped.

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:57.830
It reached the bottom.

00:17:57.830 --> 00:18:01.540
Okay, flip back the ring and tighten the line.

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:03.080
Okay.

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:07.200
W-Wow! There're so many!

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:09.830
They're being lured in by
the chum. Here they come!

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:13.540
Here we go!

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:15.250
Wh-What should I do?

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.250
Reel it in!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.330
I caught one.

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:27.910
I caught one!

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:29.830
Not bad.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.370
'Kay, let me see your hand.

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:33.450
I-It won't bite, will it?

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:35.200
Nope, it won't.

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:38.330
It's so small! Even though it felt
so heavy when I pulled it up.

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.830
How's it so strong?

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:43.870
And it's so shiny...

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:47.160
I didn't know fish had such pretty colors.

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:49.950
Make sure ya put it in
the cooler after ya catch them.

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:54.120
My hands smell so fishy!

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:56.750
Well, duh. You held a fish.

00:18:56.750 --> 00:19:01.080
We still got plenty of chum.
Better start fishin' or it's gonna get dark.

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:02.830
O-Okay.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:05.080
You're not fishing, President?

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:08.120
I don't like fishin' in a hurry.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.500
Hina! Hina!

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:11.910
What is it?

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:14.500
Even if you catch one, don't pull it up yet.

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:15.750
Just hang tight for a bit.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:18.910
If you wait a while before you reel it in...

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:21.250
Wow! You caught three!

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:24.040
Ohno-<i>senpai</i>'s caught a full load.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.830
I-Is she a master?

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:29.080
Okay, I'll try again!

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.870
I feel one!

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:33.830
D-Do I still have to wait?
They're pulling really hard.

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:35.790
Just wait a little longer.

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:38.660
Yay! I caught two!

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:41.120
Okay, now try pulling them off yourself.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:43.660
Huh? Okay...

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.080
Just go for it already!

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:51.450
Its mouth is all stretchy!
Its mouth is all stretchy!

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.250
I got it off!

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:12.370
Yay, I caught four!

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:14.330
Yeah! I caught five!

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:18.330
We caught so many!

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:19.870
It's the motherload!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:24.870
Wait! She's frying them up here?
When did she...?

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:28.040
Nice, Ohno-<i>senpai</i>. Way to go.

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.040
Here you go.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:31.500
You can even eat the bones.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.700
Thanks for the grub!

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:39.540
I guess I'll try one.

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:41.080
Let's eat.

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:44.790
I-It's so good!

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:53.790
Last one's mine.

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:56.660
Nope! You didn't catch any
and you already ate too many.

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:58.410
This one's for Hina!

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:03.000
So, how was fishin'?

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:06.410
It was... a lot of fun.

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:10.000
I see. Ended up being a great experience, huh?

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:12.200
Yes!

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.370
Right then.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.700
Let's start cleanin' up.

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:16.580
'Kay.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:18.580
Um...

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:21.000
So...

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.080
...about the Breakwater Club...

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:25.160
Can I stay a little longer?

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:26.450
Hina!

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:30.500
We'll welcome ya with open arms. Enjoy yer stay.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:35.080
Thank you. Oh, but I don't think
I can handle octopi or big fish yet...

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.910
Okay, okay.

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:39.580
I'll show you the ropes!

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:41.750
Th-Thanks...

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:45.500
All right. Tsurugi, will you wash out
the bucket that had the chum in it?

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:47.250
Oka--

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:54.660
Never mind, I quit!

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:58.290
Today's haiku...

00:21:58.290 --> 00:21:59.790
"Remember the rules

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:01.290
when you're <i>sabiki </i>fishing

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:02.950
at the breakwater.

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:04.500
By Hina."
